---
interface Props {
  photoCount: number;
  seriesCount: number;
  yearRange: string;
}

const { photoCount, seriesCount, yearRange } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="mt-12" aria-label="图集手记">
  <div class="card relative overflow-hidden p-6 sm:p-10">
    <span
      class="material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-6 -right-4 select-none text-[9rem] text-primary/5"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
      camera
    </span>

    <div class="relative grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 lg:col-span-4">
        <p class="eyebrow flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-secondary" aria-hidden="true">
            auto_fix_high
          </span>
          Notes &amp; Archive · 图集手记
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary">视觉手记 · 定格多维光影</h2>
        <span class="text-label-sm text-muted">Written by 风屿 · 记录于工作室与数字暗房</span>

        <dl class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 border-t border-line pt-4 text-center">
          <div>
            <dt class="meta">影像收录</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 font-headline-md text-headline-md font-medium text-primary tabular-nums">{photoCount}</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="meta">视觉系列</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 font-headline-md text-headline-md font-medium text-primary tabular-nums">{seriesCount}</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="meta">记录年份</dt>
            <dd class="mt-1 font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-medium text-primary tabular-nums">{yearRange}</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 lg:col-span-8 lg:border-l lg:border-line lg:pl-8">
        <p class="text-body-lg leading-relaxed text-primary">
          无论动漫笔触、真实街景还是虚拟 CG 渲染，图像的本质都是对某一缕光线与情绪的提炼与永久留存。
        </p>
        <p class="text-body-md leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
          大学生活往往被
          DDL、绩点和未来的不确定性塞得满满当当。而按下快门或涂抹画面的那一瞬，是为数不多让我从奔忙中强行抽离的时刻。35
          毫米画幅与画布框住的不仅是风景，更是专注度。当你开始期待光线如何穿透一片落叶、积水如何倒映霓虹招牌、黄昏的影子如何在红砖墙上拉长，原本沉闷重复的校园日子便重新拥有了纹理与温度。
        </p>
        <p class="border-l-2 border-accent-decor pl-4 text-body-sm italic text-on-surface-variant">
          “定格不可复制的一瞬，是向时间温柔反抗的唯一方式。”
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
